常规、心电图变化。上述安全性指标在治疗期及治疗结束后30天安全性随访期内进行监测。","rationale":"安全性终点内容来源于当前项目已确认研究事实中的安全性终点条目。允许来源未列出任何次要疗效终点，因此本章节仅写入已确认的安全性终点。医学经理需确认：是否需增设次要疗效终点；安全性终点中各项指标的具体采集时点与频率；低血压事件的判定阈值与处理流程。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_636dc73860ce_79edfb025e9562c7","section_number":"3.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:7295320e64d5e1962dcf56b0","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:r4:ce444b99d8bb7f54"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261010022326_99ee2182","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"恢复本章节正文与当前项目来源的证据绑定后重新核对。","category":"mapping_failed","gap_id":"gap:evidence-binding","missing_source_classes":[],"target":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_636dc73860ce_e36b08f443f3e3d2"}],"heading":"探索性目的和探索性终点","missing_source_classes":["支持本章节正文的当前项目直接来源"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本次输出未能把正文绑定到有效证据；需补充或重新绑定支持本章节的当前项目直接来源。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_636dc73860ce_e36b08f443f3e3d2","section_number":"3.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:7295320e64d5e1962dcf56b0","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:r4:ce444b99d8bb7f54"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261010022326_99ee2182","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:revision:4","quote":"总体研究设计：随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心II期剂量探索研究","quote_sha256":"2f5022140d2275d33560ae4bdb963c9a887859c61977316b91cfd69524bb8143","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:r4:ce444b99d8bb7f54","span_id":"es_design"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:revision:4","quote":"KZ-sGC1601薄膜衣片：2.5mg、5mg、10mg每日一次（口服）；第1天至第12周（每日一次，随餐）。依从：每日服药日记卡记录","quote_sha256":"cf1d2d5de2765b1efa324fa527be34059981fc063051a3793092153ccd5fbca1","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:r4:ce444b99d8bb7f54","span_id":"es_dose"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:revision:4","quote":"安慰剂对照（双模拟）：安慰剂薄膜衣片口服每日一次，与KZ-sGC1601同步使用12周；受试者按随机分配至安慰剂组或不同剂量试验组。","quote_sha256":"b56f7be931d1ec9c3eac447666722e7abd4d70810ab136706a82476847b73066","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:r4:ce444b99d8bb7f54","span_id":"es_placebo"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:revision:4","quote":"中国成年慢性心力衰竭（LVEF≤40%，NYHA II-III级）患者，标准治疗基础上症状仍持续","quote_sha256":"cb614f9642c6b11fe626282bfa427aadfd09329dd9534215de6018c0b3a653f4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:r4:ce444b99d8bb7f54","span_id":"es_population"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:revision:4","quote":"访视策略：筛选（V1）、基线（V2，第1天）、V3第2周、V4第4周、V5第8周、V6第12周（终点）与30天安全性随访","quote_sha256":"8c1d7ca018b8e46d9855ddbef7bd76b1aaf361c4c16d87cdef4a5ba0fb2cc13e","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:r4:ce444b99d8bb7f54","span_id":"es_visit"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:revision:4","quote":"按主要终点NT-proBNP组间差异估算，每组约100例；考虑脱落率15%，总样本量约240例","quote_sha256":"b381010c2eddcd050a510e2b619aaa373df0dd63e2bef7b69b3645209d1d0e4c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:r4:ce444b99d8bb7f54","span_id":"es_sample_size"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:revision:4","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：-28至-1天；治疗期：第1天至第12周；随访期：治疗结束后30天安全性随访","quote_sha256":"6d2ffc7852b9e349b8539673d0c52951b04fc124307d79f1a27bc778fac1d5cc","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:r4:ce444b99d8bb7f54","span_id":"es_periods"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:revision:4","quote":"入选标准模块：年龄18-75岁；筛选期LVEF≤40%；NYHA II-III级；稳定标准心衰治疗≥4周；签署知情同意","quote_sha256":"9b5c11f1282564f053da70bcc4d8992c056a043cc57f937c542daba8c6d3b5d7","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:r4:ce444b99d8bb7f54","span_id":"es_inclusion"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:revision:4","quote":"排除标准模块：eGFR<30mL/min/1.73m2；收缩压<90mmHg；近6个月内心肌梗死或卒中；妊娠或哺乳期；对sGC类药物过敏","quote_sha256":"87570baae0ec9acd27353807c7203c8af459cedec3c6c31f5d4e2cf0505f9ae5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:r4:ce444b99d8bb7f54","span_id":"es_exclusion"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:revision:4","quote":"内在研究目的：概念验证（PoC）；剂量探索","quote_sha256":"2d096e242bbd65d0c9236718d79e77a388e84cb9640b99bd47662a6ce8faab31","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:r4:ce444b99d8bb7f54","span_id":"es_intrinsic_purpose"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_design","es_dose","es_placebo","es_population","es_visit","es_sample_size","es_periods","es_inclusion","es_exclusion","es_intrinsic_purpose"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":10},"gap_items":[],"heading":"研究设计","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为一项随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心II期剂量探索研究，在中国开展，旨在评价口服sGC刺激剂KZ-sGC1601在慢性心力衰竭（射血分数降低，HFrEF）患者中的概念验证与剂量探索。研究人群为中国成年慢性心力衰竭（LVEF≤40%，NYHA II-III级）患者，在标准心衰治疗基础上症状仍持续。入选标准为年龄18至75岁、筛选期LVEF≤40%、NYHA II-III级、稳定标准心衰治疗≥4周并签署知情同意；排除标准包括eGFR<30mL/min/1.73m²、收缩压<90mmHg、近6个月内心肌梗死或卒中、妊娠或哺乳期、对sGC类药物过敏。受试者按随机分配至安慰剂组或KZ-sGC1601 2.5mg、5mg、10mg每日一次口服组，共四个平行组。试验药与安慰剂均采用薄膜衣片剂型，每日一次随餐口服，采用双模拟设计以维持盲法。治疗期为第1天至第12周，依从性通过每日服药日记卡记录。研究时期包括筛选期（-28至-1天）、治疗期（第1天至第12周）和治疗结束后30天安全性随访期。访视安排为筛选（V1）、基线（V2，第1天）、V3第2周、V4第4周、V5第8周、V6第12周（终点）及30天安全性随访。样本量按主要终点NT-proBNP组间差异估算，每组约100例，考虑15%脱落率后总样本量约240例。","rationale":"研究设计、人群、入排标准、剂量、给药方案、安慰剂设计、访视策略、研究时期和样本量均来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。医学经理需确认：每组约100例中每组是否包含安慰剂组，四组总样本量240例的分配方式；双模拟设计的具体实施细节；各访视中具体评估项目清单；随机化方法（区组大小、分层因素）；盲法维持与紧急揭盲流程。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（研究设计）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点、样本量）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_636dc73860ce_cd8a71a11223f4f3","section_number":"4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:7295320e64d5e1962dcf56b0","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:r4:ce444b99d8bb7f54"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"86624c638c76c6b638034981d54cde04a8f40aa36776200ad479aedb629d2e9f","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_636dc73860ce_a3ac41b7c738ed6e:full-draft:7295320e64d5e1962dcf56b0","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:7295320e64d5e1962dcf56b0","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:b03335af2adf362c569a95e50f5bce42edd7fe858a7a156dcf5d275f1a8e8ac8:7295320e64d5e1962dcf56b0","text_sha256":"86624c638c76c6b638034981d54cde04a8f40aa36776200ad479aedb629d2e9f"},{"content_sha256":"0e09c4ee71bb993452ae8c12ede83a94df75a1a869125d5ebc2254fddf553133","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:revision:4","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:r4:ce444b99d8bb7f54","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_29728c7097c3c43e460b:r4:ce444b99d8bb7f54","text_sha256":"0e09c4ee71bb993452ae8c12ede83a94df75a1a869125d5ebc2254fddf553133"}]}